  "body": "What happens: the motion test `pocket_outside::adaptive_spiral_round_a_part_outside_equals_main_before_3818` (binary `pass_start_levels`) fails on upstream/main c65757d07. The hash of the path does not agree with the golden.\n\n```\nthread 'pocket_outside::adaptive_spiral_round_a_part_outside_equals_main_before_3818' panicked at crates/motion/tests/pass_start_levels/pocket_outside.rs:163:5:\n  left: 131034927421005443\n right: 13996707157284497335\n```\n\nHow found: the quick gate of #3631 on macOS (aarch64). The #3631 branch does not change this generator. The test also fails with `crates/motion` set back to upstream/main (`cargo xtask gate test adaptive_spiral_round_a_part_outside_equals_main_before_3818 --crate camcraft-motion --binary pass_start_levels`).\n\nNot known: if the failure is on macOS only (a float difference), or on all systems. The last merge on main was #3837 (pocket ring scope).\n\nExpected: the test passes on main, or the golden is recorded again with a reason.\n",
